# Terraform — keep .terraform.lock.hcl COMMITTED (pins provider checksums)
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf

# Never: credentials of any kind (the design uses none, keep it that way)
*.json.key
*-key.json
credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# Local tooling
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
checkov.sarif
